            "Speed",
            "Senior or specialist review",
            "Summary",
            "Source code"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explain": "PAUSE = Privacy, Accuracy, Understanding, Senior/specialist review, Edit."
        },
        {
          "q": "How much verification does an answer need?",
          "options": [
