          "correct": 1,
          "explain": "Narrowing scope can be the right call rather than scaling or abandoning wholesale."
        },
        {
          "q": "A fair comparison uses…",
          "options": [
            "Different tasks for old and new",
            "The same task, sample and quality standard, with enough cases",
            "One easy example",
            "Only the new process"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
